<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels continue advancing in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning a 3,300‑house project to ease the Goma housing crisis, while ADF gunmen keep killing civilians in Ituri province. FARDC commanders and UPDF forces assessed joint operations against ADF in Cantine, and MONUSCO escorted 380 civilians after clashes in Ituri. Kabila rebels shot down a DRC fighter jet, and Rwanda is preparing to serve as a European deportation hub for asylum seekers, prompting diplomatic protest from the DRC. Kenya and the DRC are discussing a détente at a quadripartite summit in Oyo, Republic of Congo. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNcS11cVFvdkxIb204RHl5SktwRVRZeE4xMjY3YmZBRW9WYlNldEJqN1FBdG1iRlZxSGhLd2k3WTZodnlzbWNNMU5fdmxySmdJLVdMcGJSeFEtSGphYjVjRExzbkxtSWZFY1RjTXppWVJXSXVhVEUwNGNKdnRQVk1uTTFSVTZSSXE0Y2h6bjVuLU1HVEpoa1AxSGxBWUhOTlhhMVFrM1BVWlE0em8taGdPMzBGRVo0UXExaFVKeHIweEg3cnJJWkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNdm9HQkdpV05IOXgtNU9iOTBRNXF1Z2xqcmY4V0VJaVpndkJMa1lSdlZnX2VpZFN4a0tJSVBwV0xxclNuTTd3enpJOWZyMzFnSkdhcXBpeWkybnQzd3NNSU5kYmdEdzVOMlVPSUhaUW1HcWZXZDF4Tk1pX09HWXVfOENJSmVSTlVqd3pKcmFjQnJ3cHlaQ0FySkhWdG5kamcwU3BBZl9IUVZ4eUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;UPDF&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNQV9COHFnUHNkTnp5aXhVaXJWaHZMRFRzMElDT3Y5Zk43TnJVZ1l0RmNURkZPWTNpMzd2R01jekV5LVRGaGk3c2pBTU0zZ2NMQzRBcG5JZWU3R3Vuck9CdGtSc0